CONGRATULATIONS!
Your event request has been approved
================================================================================

Hi <%= @event_request.organizer_name %>,

Great news! Your event request has been approved and is now live on EventHub.

EVENT DETAILS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Title:          <%= @event_request.event_title %>
Date:           <%= @event_request.preferred_date.strftime("%B %d, %Y") %>
Time:           <%= @event_request.preferred_time %>
Location:       <%= @event_request.is_remote? ? "Remote - #{@event_request.platform}" : @event_request.venue_address %>
<% if @event_request.event_capacity.present? -%>
Capacity:       <%= @event_request.event_capacity %> attendees
<% end -%>
Ticket Price:   <%= @event_request.ticket_price > 0 ? "$#{@event_request.ticket_price}" : "Free" %>

Your event is now visible to all EventHub users and attendees can start registering.

View your event: <%= event_url(@event) %>

If you have any questions or need to make changes to your event, please contact us.

